@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a user; substitute the returned id below
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Stepan","email":"stepan@example.com"}

### Create subscription; retry with the same key and body
POST {{host}}/api/subscriptions/create
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 75be42df-1323-48c2-a317-55bb64445a1b

{"userId":1,"plan":"basic"}

### Current state
GET {{host}}/api/subscriptions/1

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready
